cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolchain in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "piano-to-guitar: arrange piano sheet music and MusicXML band scores into playable electric guitar tabs"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yangyi
    family-names: Liu
    alias: starryark
repository-code: "https://github.com/starryark/piano-to-guitar"
abstract: >-
  A Node.js toolchain that arranges a piano score or a multi-instrument band
  score (MusicXML or AlphaTex) into a playable solo electric-guitar tab in
  AlphaTex, with machine gates for guitar playability and melodic and harmonic
  fidelity, and a human-in-the-loop workflow designed for AI coding agents.
keywords:
  - guitar tablature
  - piano to guitar
  - MusicXML
  - music arrangement
  - alphaTab
  - AlphaTex
  - electric guitar
  - LLM agents
version: "1.0.0"
